hi I'm Tiffani Thiessen and today I'm  making my mom's famous cream cheese pie  I love this cream cheese pie one because  it has cheese in it and I'm a cheese  lover and two because it was something  that my mom always made and it was  something that brought memories every  time I would have a bite I remember  literally growing up having this cream  cheese pie at every special occasion and  holiday I don't remember exactly the  first time I made this pie and it was  quite a long time ago and I do remember  being very nervous about it because it's  a staple in our family and I wanted to  make sure I did it right what's unique  about this recipe is that most people  think it's a cheesecake but it's  actually not it's more of a cream cheese  pie so it has a little more of the  texture of an actual pie this cream  cheese pie is something that when I make  it for somebody who hasn't had it before  they want to know why I haven't had it  before everybody who makes it everybody  who has it it's something that gets  requested over and over and over again  and I think it's gonna be the same for  you guys we usually make the cream  cheese pie for special occasions and  mostly during the holidays but my  daughter does request it on her birthday  as well my daughter and I cook a lot  together she is now seven and a half  years old so she's getting pretty good  at it she actually has her own set of  knives kid knives of course but she's  getting really great at it she likes to  be alongside me and we are definitely  making memories in the kitchen that says  special time right now I started cooking  as a young little girl kind of pairing  my head through the corner watching the  other ladies and my family cooking  together and I wanted to be with them I  think for me being in the kitchen and  cooking it  just another expression of being  artistic I also love trying new things  and being able to be creative and trying  new ingredients and trying new  techniques is something that I love to  do and I love also what food does I love  that food brings people together it's a  communal type thing and whether it's  your family your friends or whatever I  really love what she does  oh yes  you
 

